  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sanitation and hygiene in Mandapathy Village</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will improve the means and knowledge for hygiene and sanitation practices of 30 of the most poor and vulnerable households in the village of Mandapathady, in Manmunai West DS Division in eastern Sri Lanka. It will also strengthen the capacity of the local women&#x2019;s organisation, the Women&#x2019;s Rural Development Society (WRDS), to advocate to local authorities for better service provision.</narrative>
  </description>
